Selected Full-Stack MVP Sprint Sequence item 7, US-087 follow-up, normal lane, non-UI slice.

Implemented:
- Added `executeLiveMonthAdvanceInngestHandoff` to convert validated instructor live month-advance requests into the existing shared processing/Inngest event path at `app/infrastructure/inngest/month-advance.ts:73`.
- Updated `advanceInstructorLiveMonth` to dispatch valid manual/live requests through the bounded Inngest handoff before returning the safe browser receipt at `app/(instructor)/instructor/dashboard/actions.ts:96`.
