- Added unit proof that instructor live server-action requests converge onto the shared worker event path at `app/infrastructure/inngest/month-advance.test.ts:134`.
- Updated US-086/US-087 story evidence, backlog, README, product docs, TEST_MATRIX, and sprint log.

